    "overview": "The Intex FA80MGGL 8 Kg Fully Automatic Top Load Washing Machine is designed to deliver convenient, efficient and powerful everyday washing performance. Its durable metal body provides a premium and sturdy build, while Fuzzy Logic technology automatically adjusts the washing process according to the laundry load for optimized cleaning. With 10 wash programs, the washing machine offers flexibility for different types of clothes and washing requirements. The 700 RPM spin speed and Air Dry function help reduce moisture from clothes for faster drying. Features such as Auto Imbalance Error Detection & Correction, Delay Wash, End Program Buzzer, Low Water Pressure operation and Stainless Steel Inner Drum make everyday laundry easier and more convenient. The FA80MGGL is an ideal choice for families looking for a spacious 8 Kg fully automatic washing machine with practical washing programs and durable construction.",
